{"id":"en_the-capable-lady-ceo-fu-is-crying-again","title":"The Capable Lady, CEO Fu Is Crying Again","titleEn":"The Capable Lady, CEO Fu Is Crying Again","description":"A chance meeting while making a delivery forces Su Yan to confront a truth she never suspected: her husband, whom she had dated for four years and married for three, has been lavishing billions in jewelry on a childhood friend. Rather than fall apart, she keeps her composure and waits for him, only to hand him divorce papers when she returns. The story follows her decision to walk away from the marriage and the fallout that follows. Viewers can follow the series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-capable-lady-ceo-fu-is-crying-again/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-capable-lady-ceo-fu-is-crying-again/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Billionaire","Romance","Comeback","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl5u6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-capable-lady-ceo-fu-is-crying-again_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl5u6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-capable-lady-ceo-fu-is-crying-again_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl5u6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-capable-lady-ceo-fu-is-crying-again_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl5u6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-capable-lady-ceo-fu-is-crying-again_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble